meta {
  name: Login WhatsApp (Request OTP)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/login/whatsapp/request
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "phone_number": "081234567890"
  }
}

docs {
  # Login WhatsApp (Request OTP)
  Mengirimkan kode OTP login ke nomor WhatsApp pengguna.
  
  ### Expected Response (200 OK):
  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Kode OTP berhasil dikirimkan ke nomor WhatsApp Anda.",
    "data": {
      "phone_number": "081234567890",
      "expires_in": 300
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Error Response (404 Not Found):
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Nomor WhatsApp tidak terdaftar."
  }
  ```
  
  ### Error Response (429 Too Many Requests):
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Terlalu banyak permintaan OTP. Silakan coba lagi dalam beberapa menit."
  }
  ```
}
